# Determinism-matrix rows on which a level overlay's anti-piracy scan runs
# to its end (tests/harness/check_determinism_matrix.sh, games/spyro-3/
# features/antipiracy_scan.c). One row per line: the bk2 stem under
# games/spyro-3/bk2/, the cell's VBL limit, and the least number of
# `antipiracy: ... complete: PASS` lines each cell's log must carry. A cell
# below that count, or carrying an `antipiracy: FAIL` line, fails the run:
# a scan that stops running or fails is a gate failure.
#
# sheilas-alp-idle-scan: no input after --skip-to-level sheilas_alp; the
# three scanner mobies of func_level_16_80079AF4 end their EXE and overlay
# passes at VBL 8091 (3261 calls each). The one-function scanner
# func_level_16_80079654 takes one step and stops while idle; it is not
# counted.
sheilas-alp-idle-scan 8600 3
